  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women-Inclusive Finance Sector Development Program Subprogram 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Subprogram 2 concludes a series of Asian Development Bank (ADB) policy-based loans (PBLs) and is complemented by additional financing for a financial intermediation loan (FIL) targeting women beneficiaries, as well as a subsequent set of activities under a post-program partnership framework (PPPF). The integrated measures of the sector development program (SDP) continue to (i) formulate women-centered policies and regulations, (ii) enhance the supply of finance to women enterprises and households, (iii) build the capacity of women entrepreneurs, and (iv) increase women representation in the financial services industry.</narrative>
  </description>
